        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle CU 36 – Ordenando personalizado (Error)\n\nactor Cliente as C\nboundary \&quot;V_Documentos\&quot; as VDocs\ncontrol \&quot;C_docs_bp (Negocio)\&quot; as C_docs_bp\ncontrol \&quot;C_api (Gateway)\&quot; as API\ncontrol \&quot;C_sort (Backend)\&quot; as C_sort\ndatabase \&quot;PostgreSQL\&quot; as DB\n\nC -&gt; VDocs: aplicarOrden(campo=\&quot;autor\&quot;)\nVDocs -&gt; C_docs_bp: aplicarOrden(campo)\n\nalt Campo no soportado\n  C_docs_bp --&gt; VDocs: mostrarError(\&quot;Campo de orden no soportado.\&quot;)\n  return\nelse OK\nend\n\nC_docs_bp -&gt; API: GET /api/docs?sort=autor\nAPI -&gt; C_sort: ordenar(\&quot;autor\&quot;, userId)\n\nalt Error SQL\n  C_sort -&gt; DB: SELECT ... ORDER BY autor\n  DB --&gt; C_sort: ERROR\n  C_sort --&gt; API: 500\n  API --&gt; C_docs_bp: 500\n  C_docs_bp --&gt; VDocs: mostrarError(\&quot;No se pudo ordenar por autor.\&quot;)\nend\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="u5HtYwv2sNDIYBacq9Vb-1">
